@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #59636E
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FAF7F0
skinparam classBorderColor #314047
skinparam classFontColor #223139
skinparam stereotypeFontColor #9A4F28
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8E9D6
skinparam noteBorderColor #D8B794
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam titleFontColor #223139
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #C8CED1
hide empty members
title Decorator — composable meal toppings
left to right direction
interface Meal <<component>> {
  + id() : String
  + name() : String
  + category() : MealCategory
  + price() : BigDecimal
}
abstract class BaseMeal <<base product>>
class Pizza <<concrete component>>
class Pasta <<concrete component>>
abstract class ToppingDecorator <<decorator>> {
  # wrapped : Meal
  - toppingName : String
  - extraPrice : BigDecimal
  + price() : BigDecimal
  + name() : String
}
class ExtraCheese <<concrete decorator>> {
  + ExtraCheese(meal)
}
class Mushrooms <<concrete decorator>> {
  + Mushrooms(meal)
}
class Olives <<concrete decorator>> {
  + Olives(meal)
}
Meal <|.. BaseMeal
BaseMeal <|-- Pizza
BaseMeal <|-- Pasta
Meal <|.. ToppingDecorator
ToppingDecorator o--> Meal : wraps one component
ToppingDecorator <|-- ExtraCheese
ToppingDecorator <|-- Mushrooms
ToppingDecorator <|-- Olives
note bottom of ToppingDecorator
price = wrapped.price + extraPrice
Identity and category are delegated.
Metadata comes from ToppingType.
Drinks reject toppings.
end note
note bottom of ExtraCheese
Cheese +400 KZT; mushrooms +300;
olives +250 per decorated unit.
end note
@enduml
